# Code owners for the harness's frozen / trust-boundary paths (design §13.5, §13.6; docs/harness.md).
# Changes here need review from the owner. Branch protection must enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" for this to block merges. The ci-guardrails extension (.github/extensions/ci-guardrails)
# also denies agent edits to the frozen subset (FROZEN_PATHS / FROZEN_DIRS in policy.mjs).
# Keep the two lists in sync; tests/ci_lab/lint/test_codeowners.py checks it.
# In a repository created from the template, `ci-lab template init --owners ...` rewrites the owners;
# the expected owners are recorded in .github/template.yml (docs/template.md).

